{local_glossary}

# Input Format
JSON Array: [{{"id": 1, "text": "English..."}}]

# Task
Translate to Chinese (Literal).

# Output Format
必须通过调用 `submit_literal_translation` 函数提交结果，JSON 格式如下：
{{
  "translations": [
    {{
      "id": 1,
      "trans": "直译后的中文"
    }}
  ]
}}

<Input>
{json_input}

# Output
Please call the function with the results. Do not provide any conversational response.
